# 043 · Progress charts

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.5.0](../roadmap.md#v050)

## What

A chart for each lane of the best result so far, with kept, reverted and crashed attempts as points, and a view of which attempt came from which.

## Why

The operator should see at a glance whether a campaign still makes progress.

## Done when

- [ ] A mockup was approved before the build.
- [ ] The charts are on the run page.

